  ['Source-verification before adoption','Every external claim fetched and read; 3/3 external drafts audited — 11/15, then 2-broken-links, then 6/6 valid (improvement documented)'],
  ['Retraction exclusion','Shah 2017 (minocycline/FK506, retracted 2020) banned by rule; minocycline also confounds NfL (Gentile 2024) &rarr; cohort exclusion criterion'],
