  ['R5','Graft survival 15-30% (active disease)','**HA-hydrogel pro-survival carrier** (Liang 2013; Nih 2017; 0.45) · peri-op immunomodulation banned (retracted lit.; Cheng 2015)'],
  ['R6','Allograft rejection','Hypoimmune HLA-KO+CD47 (Hu 2024 macaque; Pavan 2025 neural) · HLA-homozygous bank (2nd line)'],
